  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mr.S.Sugendran vs Unknown on 26 September, 2025 Author: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Bench: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 26.09.2025 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Suo Motu TR.No.17793 of 2025 (C.C.No.115 of 2018 of Judicial Magistrate Court, Dharapuram, Dharapu Taluk, Tiruppur)",
    "facts": "This case is registered for alleged offence under Sections 52, 51, 59(1) and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. The incident occurred on 30.08.2016. The allegation in this case is that the accused are selling misbranded, substandard and unsafe violating the guidelines under Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. It is stated that they are admitting the crime and submits that they are not indulging in selling such food anymore. Considering the quantity and the nature of the business and the accused have been facing this case from the year 2018, lenient view is taken upon admission.",
